abstract: >-
  Analysis code, the frozen analysis protocol with dated addenda, the verified
  bibliography, figure-generation scripts, and verbatim execution logs for the
  manuscript "From Error Curves to an Estimated Weight: A Model-Based Reanalysis
  of Perspective Taking Across Adulthood." The dataset analyzed is Bradford,
  Brunsdon & Ferguson's (2023) open data (https://osf.io/2epsu/), cited rather
  than redistributed; it is not contained in this archive.
